OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA warm
OL,6,Fevening with some sunshine and just
OL,7,Fthe outside chance of a shower. Many
OL,8,Fplaces missing these though and
OL,9,Fstaying dry throughout the evening and
OL,10,Fnight. Remaining warm and humid,
OL,11,Fespecially in urban areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FAny showers first thing
OL,14,Fclearing to leave a dry day with sunny
OL,15,Fperiods becoming prolonged. Notably
OL,16,Fcooler and breezier than on Tuesday
OL,17,Fbut nevertheless feeling warm in the
OL,18,Fstrong sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
