OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FRemaining dry with a mixture of cloudy
OL,7,Fspells and prolonged periods of strong
OL,8,Fsunshine. Not as hot compared to
OL,9,Frecently, but still warm with
OL,10,Ftemperatures rising again into the
OL,11,Fweekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
